          "id": "0bb7fd0d37915795d79214eb2f705d88807f3058",
          "message": "Feat/error tail (#918)\n\n* feat: implement error policy tail for expressions and statements\n\n* feat: add 'FAIL' keyword to error policy handling and update related logic\n\n* feat: implement recovery tails for error handling and update related logic\n\n* feat: enhance recovery handling for WAITFOR and FOR expressions with improved error routing\n\n* feat: implement retry action in error handling with delay and backoff options\n\n* feat: implement retry recovery plan with delay and backoff handling\n\n* refactor: remove unused retry recovery compile logic and migrate constants and helpers to core package\n\n* refactor: migrate error policy handling to centralized OperationPolicyCompiler and remove redundant internal implementations\n\n* refactor: remove fallback query from benchmarks and use primary retried host call query",
