          "distinct": true,
          "id": "01136ac84ac9ba82e2ad44debdf0cf74ba6d8d8d",
          "message": "Chore/compiler cleanup (#919)\n\n* refactor: rename internal components for clarity and migrate variableDeclarationName helper\n\n* refactor: replace EmitMoveAuto method with emitMoveAuto helper for consistent and modular value transfer logic\n\n* refactor: streamline recovery logic by introducing normalizeRecoveryPlan and revising protected regions\n\n* refactor: streamline recovery logic by introducing normalizeRecoveryPlan and revising protected regions\n\n* refactor: centralize UDF compilation logic, improve capture analysis, and enhance function resolution\n\n* refactor: extract and relocate helpers, rename getFunctionName to resolveFunctionName, and realign sortDirection function location\n\n* refactor: simplify and clarify type-centered file structure rules in AGENTS.md\n\n* refactor: remove unused helpers and consolidate recovery logic into RecoveryCompiler\n\n* refactor: unify binding capture logic and replace redundant udfCaptureBinding with shared captureBindingInfo type\n\n* refactor: remove WaitCompiler and associated helpers, streamlining internal compilation logic by eliminating unused WAITFOR expression handling\n\n* refactor: integrate new operation recovery spec and remove legacy recovery handling methods across core components\n\n* refactor: consolidate UDF compilation state management into withFunctionCompileState, improve nested state handling, and update related tests\n\n* refactor: add invariant checks and improve error diagnostics for numeric literals, function arity, and loop handling\n\n* refactor: replace frontend references with explicit bindings, streamline compiler dependencies, and consolidate collaborator wiring\n\n* refactor: replace ensureRegister with ensureOperandRegister, add RecoveryCompiler to LoopCompiler and WaitCompiler, and update cross-compiler recovery logic\n\n* refactor: extract query and match expression compilers, consolidate helpers, and update related benchmarks\n\n* refactor: consolidate session access under Program and Function contexts, standardizing references across compilers and emitters\n\n* refactor: extract host-level state to ProgramContext, replace SymbolTable bindings with HostParamTable and HostFunctionTable, and update related tests\n\n* refactor: enhance WAITFOR EVENT handling with result propagation, improve iteration and recovery logic, and add timeout-aware event filtering\n\n* refactor: extract duration validation and parsing logic, consolidate duration handling across WAITFOR and retry delay compilers, and add tests for out-of-range literals\n\n* test: add binding compiler tests for failed initializers and promoted declarations, ensuring correct binding behavior and diagnostic handling\n\n* refactor: remove unused internal helpers and outdated duration parsing logic, reorganize wait-related compiler components, and add helper functions for member expressions\n\n* refactor: move assignmentOperatorText helper to binding_helpers for better organization\n\n* refactor: remove unused src parameter from declareBinding in BindingCompiler\n\n* refactor: add nil check for compile in CompileWithErrorPolicy to prevent potential runtime issues\n\n* refactor: extract invariant helpers into a separate file for better organization and reuse\n\n* refactor: add NotNil spec helper, improve error messaging for nil checks, and update test for WAITFOR EVENT retries",
