          "message": "Feat/extend queriable (#940)\n\n* feat: add QUERY ONE, COUNT, and EXISTS support to queryable interface\n\n* feat: remove QUERY ANY and QUERY VALUE modifiers, replace with QUERY ONE\n\n* feat: remove legacy query modifiers and related error handling\n\n* feat: add support for query-one shorthand with TildeQuestion operator\n\n* feat: remove legacy query modifier handling and related error messages\n\n* feat: update query error handling and remove legacy modifiers",
