          "message": "feat: add benchmarks and tests for array question lowering and expansion (#947)\n\n* feat: add benchmarks and tests for array question lowering and expansion\n\n* fix: lower bare @arr[?] to O(1) check instead of materializing a list (#948)\n\n* Initial plan\n\n* fix: lower bare @arr[?] to iterator early-exit instead of materializing a list\n\nReplace compileArrayIteration (OpDataSet + OpPush loop) with:\n- OpLength directly on src for known measurable types (fast path)\n- Iterator-based early-exit (OpIter, OpIterNext once, OpClose) for the\n  general Iterable case\n\nThis avoids iterating all elements and allocating a new list just to\ncheck emptiness.\n\n* docs: add comments explaining measurable check and iterator early-exit pattern\n\n* Potential fix for pull request finding\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Strengthen bare array question test assertions\n\n- Assert absence of OpPush (not just OpDataSet) to catch list materialization\n- Assert exactly one strategy (OpLength XOR OpIter), not both/neither\n- Validate OpIterNext is present when OpIter strategy is used\n- Fix extra closing brace in expr_member_helpers.go\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Tim Voronov <ziflex@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Potential fix for pull request finding\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Potential fix for pull request finding\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: improve measurable type handling for OpLength and add benchmarks/tests for array question lowering\n\n* feat: enhance range handling with Length method, negative range support, and improved tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
