          "distinct": true,
          "id": "6b5fc6fb232c5cd468a88b3037cdd811ba15aa16",
          "message": "feat: introduce HTTP policies for sandboxed HTTP Client  (#968)\n\n* feat: introduce HTTP policies for connection validation and enhance security testing\n\n* refactor(http): convert Policies fields to private to enforce encapsulation\n\n* refactor(http): remove package qualifier for `Policies` usage in tests to simplify code\n\n* refactor(http): simplify tests by removing package qualifier for client usage\n\n* refactor(http): consolidate Policies into Policy, add method and header validation, normalize API\n\n* refactor(http): replace fmt.Errorf with typed errors and add tests\n\n* refactor(http): update test context initialization and enhance error handling\n\n* refactor(http): introduce `MultiPolicyConfigurationError` for aggregated errors, enhance validation logic, and update tests\n\n* refactor(tests): enhance loopback HTTP policy tests with improved structure, explicit error checks, and added localhost opt-in validation\n\n* refactor(http): unify request handling by consolidating policy evaluation and preparation logic, improve validation and error handling, and update tests\n\n* refactor(http): ensure context is always initialized in `toStdRequest` to prevent `nil` context usage\n\n* refactor(http): remove redundant context initialization in `toStdRequest`\n\n* refactor(http): add nil check for `CloseIdleConnections` to improve safety\n\n* refactor(net): move `CloseIdleNetworkConnections` to `helpers.go` for better package organization and add nil check for improved safety",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-20T09:13:25-04:00",
